  message: "Merged as PR #2767. bakeoff-deep init now warns when a recent same-pool + same-code-hash session exists, pointing users at 'cycle' for iter-002/iter-003 instead of starting a new top-level session. Opt-out via BAKEOFF_DEEP_SKIP_RECENT_WARNING=1. 10 new tests cover the full matrix."  # 9964
